{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001C26": "「我らを憎め……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001C42": "「その闘志も糧となる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001C6A": "「呪え、我らを……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001C89": "「我らを止めることは出来ぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001CBA": "「憎悪を増幅させるがいい……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001CE8": "「お前の憎しみは、その程度か……？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001D1F": "「足りぬ……もっと憎め、叫べ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001D4D": "「心地よき負の波動……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001D72": "「その憎悪、闘志……我らが受け止めよう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001DAF": "「あがけ……力の限り……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001DD7": "「怨嗟の声を上げよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001DFC": "「諦めよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001E12": "「我らルイーナには勝てぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001E40": "「苦悶し、呪いの声を上げよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001E71": "「反撃不能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001E8A": "「攻撃不可能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001EA6": "「対処不可能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001EC2": "「さらなる絶望を……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001EE4": "「滅びの宿命を受け入れよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001F12": "「さらなる恐怖を……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001F34": "「死を享受せよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001F53": "「流れを断ち切る……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001F75": "「やらせん……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/216.bmd|0x001F8E": "「好転することはない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x000424": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x000434": "「！？！？！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x00044D": "「！！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x00045D": "「………！！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x000476": "「………！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/217.bmd|0x00048C": "「………？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0011A4": "「総員の奮闘を期待する」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0011C9": "「総員、レーツェル様の期待に応えるのだ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001206": "「攻撃目標、メリオルエッセ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001234": "「前方のメリオルエッセに仕掛ける！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00126B": "「攻撃目標、ゲスト指揮官機！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001299": "「本艦で指揮官機を撃破する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0012C7": "「前方のガイアセイバーズ機に仕掛ける！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001304": "「ガイアセイバーズの横暴を許すな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00133B": "「マイヤー総司令や、/　ビアン総帥のご遺志に従わぬのであれば……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0013A0": "「今のお前達に大義はあるのか……？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0013D7": "「攻撃目標、エア・クリスマス！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001408": "「攻撃目標、セイバー１！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001430": "「総員、対艦戦闘用意！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001455": "「あの黒い特機を近づけるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001483": "「攻撃目標、ジンライ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0014A8": "「攻撃目標、量産型ジンライ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0014D6": "「前方のルイーナ機を撃破する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001507": "「攻撃目標、ルイーナ機！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00152F": "「攻撃目標、デモン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001551": "「本艦でデモンを駆逐する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00157C": "「前方のデモンを撃破する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0015A7": "「攻撃目標、超機人！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0015C9": "「本艦であの超機人を阻止する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0015FA": "「攻撃目標、ＡＩ１！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00161C": "「攻撃目標、ガンエデン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001644": "「前方のゲスト機を撃破する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001672": "「本艦でゲスト機を仕留めるぞ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0016A3": "「最終攻撃目標、アダマトロン！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0016D4": "「直ちに反撃を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0016F0": "「目標を逃がすな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00170F": "「目標を追尾せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00172E": "「くっ……！　総員退艦せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00175C": "「レーツェル様、申し訳ありません……！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00179C": "「被弾箇所、報告！　ダメコンを急げ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0017D6": "「ここで沈めば、/　レーツェル様に申し訳が立たんぞ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001826": "「ぐうっ！　直撃か！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001848": "「弾幕を厚くしろ！　敵を近づけるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001882": "「終わるわけにはいかん！/　役目を果たすまでは！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0018CC": "「ゲストに後れを取るな！　反撃を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001903": "「ルイーナ機の撃破を急げ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00192E": "「デモンをこれ以上近づけるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00195F": "「ふん、面妖な連中め……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00198A": "「確実にゲスト機を撃破せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0019B8": "「破損箇所を報告せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0019DD": "「その程度で、クロガネは沈まんよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001A11": "「本艦を集中的に狙ってきたか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001A48": "「こちらは修羅場を/　何度もくぐり抜けてきているのでな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001A9B": "「回避行動を取りつつ、反撃せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001ACF": "「構わん、攻撃に専念しろ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001AF7": "「各砲座、敵機の接近を許すな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001B25": "「抵抗が弱いが、油断してはならん」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001B59": "「ふん、インスペクターと同レベルだな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001B93": "「ルイーナを接近させるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001BBE": "「デモンに食いつかれるとはな……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001BF5": "「デモンめ、本艦を狙ってきたか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001C26": "「ゲスト機を近づけるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001C4E": "「回避運動終了後、反撃に転ずる」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001C7F": "「ゲストの好きにはやらせん！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001CAD": "「本艦を狙っても無駄だ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001CD2": "「レーツェル様から預かった艦を/　傷つけるわけにはいかん」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001D28": "「エア・クリスマス相手に油断は禁物だぞ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001D65": "「このままルイーナを引き付けよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001D99": "「この調子でデモンを近づけるな！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001DCD": "「そんなものは通用せん！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001DF5": "「フィールドの展開が間に合ったか」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001E29": "「ＥＰ展開！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001E3F": "「打つ手を考えるのだな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001E64": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001E74": "「ここは防御に徹するしかないか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001EAE": "「弾薬の再装填、急げ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001ED3": "「やむを得ん、対空警戒を厳となせ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001F0A": "「目標を再度捕捉せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001F2F": "「味方機を援護する！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001F51": "「続けて攻撃せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001F70": "「レーツェル様を援護するのだ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001FA1": "「ゼンガー少佐を援護せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001FCC": "「ハガネに続け！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x001FE8": "「ヒリュウ改を援護せよ！」　", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002013": "「全速前進！　味方機を守れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002041": "「本艦を盾にするのだ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002066": "「レーツェル様、お下がりください！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00209D": "「ゼンガー少佐、後退を！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0020C5": "「ハガネを守れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0020E1": "「ヒリュウ改を守れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002103": "「目標を再度攻撃せよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002128": "「対空機銃、撃ち方始め！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x002150": "「ＡＡＷオート、撃ち方始め！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x00217E": "「ＳＴＦ魚雷、スタンバイ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0021A9": "「１番、３番、撃てーっ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/218.bmd|0x0021D1": "「艦首魚雷、スタンバイ！」"}